. Cyr. 8.1.30","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0032.tlg007.perseus-grc1:8:1:30"},", ",{"c":"Antipho 4.4.2","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0028.tlg004.perseus-grc1:4:2"},". "]],[3,"2",[" of over-fed asses, neigh or bray and prance about, ",{"g":"ὑβρίζοντες οἱ ὄνοι ἐτάρασσον τὴν ἵππον"},{"c":"Hdt. 4.129","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:4:129"},"; of horses, ",{"c":"X. Cyr. 7.5.62","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0032.tlg007.perseus-grc1:7:5:62"},"; of elephants, ",{"c":"Ael. NA 10.10","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0545.tlg001:10:10"},". "]],[3,"3",[" of plants, run riot, grow rank and luxuriant, ",{"c":"Thphr. HP 2.7.6","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0093.tlg001:2:7:6"},", ",{"c":"CP 3.15.4","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0093.tlg002:3:15:4"},". "]],[3,"4",[" metaph., of a river that swept away and drowned a horse, ",{"c":"Hdt. 1.189","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:1:189"},"; so ",{"g":"γῆ ὕβριστο"}," had been carried away by river-floods, Emp.(?)",{"c":"154","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1342.tlg001:154"},". "]],[2,"II",[" trans., ",{"g":"ὑ. τινά"}," treat him despitefully, outrage, insult, maltreat, ",{"g":"ἡμέας ὑβρίζοντες ἀτάσθαλα μηχανόωντο"}," (v. infr. ",{"c":"2","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1342.tlg001:2"},") ",{"c":"Il. 11.695","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0012.tlg001.perseus-grc1:11:695"},"; ",{"g":"ὑ. τοὺς ὑβρίζοντας χρεών"},{"c":"A. Pr. 970","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.tlg003.perseus-grc1:970"},"; ",{"g":"ὑ. γυναῖκα τὴν ἑαυτοῦ"},{"c":"And. 4.15","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0027.tlg004.perseus-grc1:15"},"; ",{"g":"με"},{"g":", ἐμέ,"},{"c":"S. Ant. 840","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg002.perseus-grc1:840"}," (lyr.), ",{"c":"Lys. 1.4","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0540.tlg001.perseus-grc1:4"},"; ",{"g":"τὰς νήσους"},{"c":"Isoc. 8.99","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0010.tlg017.perseus-grc1:99"},": more freq. (esp. in Prose) ",{"g":"ὑ. εἴς τινα"},"(s) commit an outrage upon or towards him (them), ",{"c":"E. Ph. 620","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg015.perseus-grc1:620"}," (troch.), 