20","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0012.tlg002.perseus-grc1:6:120"},",",{"c":"9.175","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0012.tlg002.perseus-grc1:9:175"},", ",{"c":"13.201","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0012.tlg002.perseus-grc1:13:201"},"; of the suitors (cf. ",{"g":"ὕβρις"},{"c":"1.1","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0012.tlg002.perseus-grc1:1:1"},"), ",{"g":"ὑ. καὶ ἀτάσθαλοι"},{"c":"24.282","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0012.tlg002.perseus-grc1:24:282"},"; ",{"g":"στρατὸν ὑβριστὴν Μήδων"}," Thgn. 775; ",{"g":"Πέρσαι φύσιν ἐόντες ὑ."},{"c":"Hdt. 1.89","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:1:89"},"; ",{"g":"ἀνδρῶν δυναστέων παῖδες ὑβρισταί"},{"c":"Id. 2.32","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0016.tlg001.perseus-grc1:2:32"},"; ",{"g":"στρατὸν θηρῶν ὑ.,"}," of the Centaurs, ",{"c":"S. Tr. 1096","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.tlg001.perseus-grc1:1096"},": also in Prose, ",{"c":"And. 4.14","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0027.tlg004.perseus-grc1:14"},", ",{"c":"Lys. 24.15","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0540.tlg024.perseus-grc1:15"},", ",{"c":"Ep.Rom. 1.30","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0031.tlg006.perseus-grc1:1:30"},", etc.; in a milder sense, sarcastic, ",{"c":"Pl. Prt. 355c","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg022:355c"},". "]],[3,"2",[" esp., opp. ",{"g":"σώφρων,"}," lustful, lewd, ",{"c":"Ar. Nu. 1068","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.tlg003.perseus-grc1:1068"}," (anap.), ",{"c":"X. Cyr. 3.1.21","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0032.tlg007.perseus-grc1:3:1:21"},", etc.; ",{"g":"ὁ εἰς ὁτιοῦν ὑ."},{"c":"Aeschin. 1.17","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0026.tlg001.perseus-grc1:17"},"; ",{"g":"ὑ. πενίης"}," insolent towards.., AP 9.172b (Pall.). "]],[3,"3",[" of animals, wanton, restive, unruly, ",{"g":"ταῦροι"},{"c":"E. Ba. 743","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0006.tlg017.perseus-grc1:743"},"; ",{"g":"ἵπποι"},{"c":"X. Cyr. 7.5.62","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0032.tlg007.perseus-grc1:7:5:62"},", cf. ",{"c":"Pl. Phdr. 254c","u":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0059.tlg012:254c"},". "]],[3,"4",[" of natural forces, ",{"g":"ὑβριστὴς Τυφάων"},{"c":"Hes. Th. 307","u":